d.construct.burst [c0bb83] = 它消失时（被打碎、时效耗尽或被取代）：在防御前对双方各造成 {n} 点法术伤害。
# en: {text} Forbidden: alignment −2 each cast; witnessed casts are reported.
d.forbidden [7be822] = {text}禁咒：每次施放，立场向空洞偏移 2；被人目击的施放会遭举报。
# en: Deal {dmg} spell damage before defenses. Parry halves it; Ward stops it.
d.spellHit [09e04b] = 在防御前造成 {dmg} 点法术伤害。招架减半；护界完全挡下。
# en: Deal {dmg} Impact damage before defenses. Parry stops it; Ward halves it.
d.physicalHit [606357] = 在防御前造成 {dmg} 点冲击伤害。招架完全挡下；护界减半。
# en: Your opponent commits first for the next {n}: you see their move before you choose.
d.foresight [ca9354] = 接下来 {n}，对手必须先出招：你能先看到对方的行动再做选择。
