# en: With observers: earn {n} Renown at settlement.{tranches}
d.glamour [97a9e3] = 有观众时：结算时获得 {n} 点声望。{tranches}
# en: With observers: pay {crowns} Crowns to earn {n} Renown at settlement (no Crowns when it would earn nothing).{tranches}
d.rapport [f52013] = 有观众时：支付 {crowns} 克朗，结算时获得 {n} 点声望（若毫无收获，则不花克朗）。{tranches}
# en: Steal up to {n} Crowns; alignment −tiny. Reflect turns it on you.{tranches}
d.sleight [85c698] = 偷取至多 {n} 克朗；立场略微偏向空洞。反照会让它落回你身上。{tranches}
# en: nothing more this fight
d.reward.none [0afa8b] = 本场不会再有收获
# en: For the next {n}, each spell you cast that deals no damage of its own and isn't a channel also throws an Impulse ({dmg} Impact damage): an attack, so it breaks your Shadowstep. Every other action you take also parries.
d.haste [c9a817] = 接下来 {n}，你施放的每个本身不造成伤害、也不是引导的法术，都会附带一次冲击（{dmg} 点冲击伤害）：这算攻击，因此会破除你的影步。你的其他每个行动都会同时招架。
# en: Evade attacks and every opposing spell effect for {n} including this one; breaks before the hits land on any exchange you attack or recover Mana.
d.shadowstep [a8385a] = 包括本回合在内的 {n} 中，闪避攻击和对方的一切法术效果；在你攻击或回收法力的回合，影步会在攻击命中之前破除。
# en: This exchange: stop every opposing spell (its damage, and Bind, poison, Torment, Omen, Compel, Extraction, Seal and the like) and half of each Impact hit. A charged Starlight gets through, and half of Wildfire's Release.
d.ward [3962e1] = 本回合：挡下对方的一切法术（其伤害，以及束缚、毒、折磨、预兆、强令、汲取、封缄等）和每次冲击的一半。蓄满的星光能穿透，野火的释放也有一半能穿透。
# en: Start channel. Release for {dmg} spell damage, or {charged} after a Hold{pierce}. Holds cost {cost} Mana.
d.starlight [88ab27] = 开始引导。释放可造成 {dmg} 点法术伤害，蓄持一次后为 {charged} 点{pierce}。每次蓄持消耗 {cost} 点法力。
# en: , which Ward doesn't stop
d.starlight.pierce [4202b2] = ，且护界挡不住
# en: Erase all their flux (loose Mana not yet recovered). Ward or stepping aside stops it; Reflect turns it on you.
d.seal [2e0e23] = 抹去对方全部游离法力（尚未回收的散逸法力）。护界或闪避可以挡下；反照会让它落回你身上。
# en: Start channel: deal {hit} spell damage now, burn yourself for {self} and bank {hit} for the Release. Each Hold does the same, its heat on you growing by {self} a Hold. Release: {hit} plus the bank as one spell hit, of which Ward stops only half. Holds cost {cost} Mana.
d.wildfire [9b8bf7] = 开始引导：现在造成 {hit} 点法术伤害，灼伤自己 {self} 点，并为释放积攒 {hit} 点。每次蓄持都如此，烧向你的热度每次蓄持增加 {self} 点。释放：以一次法术攻击造成 {hit} 点加上积攒的伤害，护界只能挡下一半。每次蓄持消耗 {cost} 点法力。
# en: Bind them for {n} from the next exchange: Breaking Free is their only action. Ward, stepping aside or Breaking Free keeps it off; Reflect turns it on you. Parry and Brace don't stop it.
d.bind [b197b3] = 从下一回合起束缚对方 {n}：挣脱是对方唯一的行动。护界、闪避或挣脱可以挡下；反照会让它落回你身上。招架与坚守挡不住。
# en: Deal {dmg} spell damage before defenses (Parry halves it) and Bind them for {n} from the next exchange: Breaking Free is their only action. Ward or stepping aside keeps both off; Reflect turns both on you.
d.bramble [8e6616] = 在防御前造成 {dmg} 点法术伤害（招架减半），并从下一回合起束缚对方 {n}：挣脱是对方唯一的行动。护界或闪避两者都能挡下；反照会让两者都落回你身上。
# en: Poison them: {dmg} damage at the end of this exchange and of the next, each before Mend, past every defense but a mature Lodestar. Nothing cures it; a new bite starts it over. Ward or stepping aside keeps it off; Reflect turns it on you.
d.poison [d67f3e] = 让对方中毒：本回合结束时和下一回合结束时各受 {dmg} 点伤害，都在愈合之前结算，除升至顶点的引星外无视一切防御。无法解毒；再咬一口则重新计时。护界或闪避可以挡下；反照会让它落回你身上。
# en: Poison them: {dmg} damage at the end of each of {n} from this one, past every defense but a mature Lodestar. Nothing cures it. Ward or stepping aside keeps it off; Reflect turns it on you.
d.poison.n [16f3ff] = 让对方中毒：从本回合起的 {n} 里，每回合结束时受 {dmg} 点伤害，除升至顶点的引星外无视一切防御。无法解毒。护界或闪避可以挡下；反照会让它落回你身上。
# en: Scatter up to {n} of their ready Mana. Ward or stepping aside stops it; Reflect turns it on you.
d.drain [1fa26a] = 驱散对方至多 {n} 点可用法力。护界或闪避可以挡下；反照会让它落回你身上。
# en: Take up to {n} of their ready Mana as your own flux. Ward or stepping aside stops it; Reflect turns it on you.
d.drain.keep [9c4ed7] = 夺取对方至多 {n} 点可用法力，化为你自己的游离法力。护界或闪避可以挡下；反照会让它落回你身上。
# en: Deal {dmg} spell damage before defenses and scatter up to {n} of their ready Mana. Ward or stepping aside stops both; Reflect turns both on you.
d.roar [6defcc] = 在防御前造成 {dmg} 点法术伤害，并驱散对方至多 {n} 点可用法力。护界或闪避两者都能挡下；反照会让两者都落回你身上。
# en: Deal {dmg} spell damage as {n} hits of {each}; only the first meets Parry and Brace.
d.hits [d007d0] = 以 {n} 次、每次 {each} 点造成共 {dmg} 点法术伤害；只有第一次会受到招架和坚守的影响。
# en: Deal {dmg} Impact damage as {n} hits of {each}; only the first meets Parry and Brace.
d.hits.physical [4e6b1e] = 以 {n} 次、每次 {each} 点造成共 {dmg} 点冲击伤害；只有第一次会受到招架和坚守的影响。
# en: Deal {dmg} spell damage now and {next} more at the end of the next exchange; each hit meets the defenses of its own exchange.
d.twoHits [dab509] = 现在造成 {dmg} 点法术伤害，下一回合结束时再造成 {next} 点；每一击都由当回合的防御应对。
# en: In the open: {n} {kind} lands {when}, before defenses. {stops}
d.delayed [cae5b4] = 公开出招：{n} 点{kind}将于{when}落下（防御前）。{stops}
# en: In the open: {n} spell damage and {m} Impact damage land together {when}, before defenses. {stops}
d.delayed.both [88a14d] = 公开出招：{n} 点法术伤害和 {m} 点冲击伤害将于{when}一同落下（防御前）。{stops}
# en: spell damage
d.kind.spell [b8504a] = 法术伤害
# en: Impact damage
d.kind.impact [9f67f0] = 冲击伤害
# en: next exchange
d.delayed.next [7dd225] = 下一回合
# en: in {n} exchanges
d.delayed.later [2f98d8] = {n} 个回合后
# en: Ward stops it, Parry halves it, Brace softens it and stepping aside dodges it.
d.stops.spell [2005fb] = 护界能挡下，招架减半，坚守削弱，闪避可以躲开。
# en: Parry stops it, Ward halves it, Brace softens it and stepping aside dodges it.
d.stops.impact [77d457] = 招架能挡下，护界减半，坚守削弱，闪避可以躲开。
# en: Ward halves it, Brace softens it and stepping aside dodges it; Parry doesn't touch it.
d.stops.impactNoGuard [16543a] = 护界减半，坚守削弱，闪避可以躲开；招架对它无效。
# en: Parry stops it, Ward halves it and stepping aside dodges it; Brace doesn't touch it.
d.stops.impactNoBrace [6e2ec7] = 招架能挡下，护界减半，闪避可以躲开；坚守对它无效。
# en: Ward stops the spell damage and halves the Impact, Brace softens both, stepping aside dodges both and Reflect returns the spell damage; Parry touches neither.
d.stops.bothNoGuard [edffee] = 护界挡下法术伤害、将冲击减半，坚守削弱两者，闪避两者都能躲开，反照能把法术伤害反弹回去；招架对两者都无效。
# en: The defenses of that exchange meet it.
d.stops.generic [dbc17e] = 由那一回合的防御来应对。
# en: Foretell two misfortunes: if it takes hold, {n} spell damage lands in two exchanges and {n} more in three. Ward or stepping aside keeps it off; Reflect turns it on you. Each hit meets the defenses of its exchange, but Brace doesn't soften it; Omens due the same exchange land as one hit.
d.omen [e0989e] = 预言两桩厄运：若应验，两个回合后降下 {n} 点法术伤害，三个回合后再降下 {n} 点。护界或闪避可以挡下；反照会让它落回你身上。每一击都由当回合的防御应对，但坚守无法削弱它；同一回合到期的预兆合为一击。
# en: Deal {dmg} cold spell damage before defenses; opposing Flame or Wildfire damage this exchange cancels with it.
d.hoarfrost [28c6b6] = 在防御前造成 {dmg} 点寒冰法术伤害；对方本回合的火焰或野火伤害会与之相互抵消。
# en: No combat effect.
d.noEffect [5d3a9f] = 在战斗中没有效果。
# en: For {n} including this one, take {pct} off all opposing damage, except Omen's. Hostile spell effects still land.
d.brace [e0e7dc] = 包括本回合在内的 {n} 中，削减对方全部伤害的 {pct}，预兆除外。敌对的法术效果照常生效。
# en: Pay {hp} HP; gain up to {n} ready Mana, capped at capacity.
d.purify [0850c9] = 支付 {hp} 点生命；获得至多 {n} 点可用法力，不超过上限。
# en: Deal {dmg} Impact damage before defenses (Parry stops it, Ward halves it). Each Tailwind straight after a Tailwind deals {step} more and costs {more} more Mana; any other move starts it over.
d.tailwind [a7012b] = 在防御前造成 {dmg} 点冲击伤害（招架能挡下，护界减半）。紧接着上一次顺风再用顺风，每次多造成 {step} 点，也多耗 {more} 点法力；做任何别的行动都会重新计起。
# en: Once a fight: arm a rescue. The first time you would fall, you freeze instead with {n} HP, through the next exchange: ordinary damage can't touch you then, but poison and Torment still can.
d.rime [7d8ca0] = 每场一次：布下保命术。你第一次将要倒下时，会改为以 {n} 点生命被冻住，直到下一回合结束：期间寻常伤害伤不到你，但毒和折磨依然可以。
# en: This exchange, return incoming hostile spells and spell damage to their source, including scheduled spell damage. Does not reflect Impact damage, poison ticks or Torment tolls. Nothing bounces twice.
d.reflect [1518d2] = 本回合，将来袭的敌对法术与法术伤害反弹回施法者，包括预定落下的法术伤害。不反弹冲击伤害、毒伤和折磨的代价。任何东西都不会被反弹两次。
# en: Start channel: bank {n} Mana now and {more} per free Hold; Release makes it ready.
d.moonwell [521190] = 开始引导：现在存入 {n} 点法力，之后每次蓄持再存 {more} 点；释放后即可使用。
# en: Kindle a star that rises for {n} exchanges. When it matures it negates all damage to you that exchange (your own included) and wards you, then heals {heal} HP. One rising at a time.
d.lodestar [cb49c5] = 点亮一颗星辰，它将上升 {n} 个回合。升至顶点的那一回合，它抵消你受到的一切伤害（包括你自己造成的），并为你筑起护界，然后为你恢复 {heal} 点生命。同一时间只能有一颗在上升。
# en: Cards/story only; not a combat cast.
d.toll [12e20a] = 仅用于卡牌与剧情；战斗中无法施放。
# en: For three exchanges including this one, each of their moves costs them {n}× the ready Mana they pay for it, in HP, past every defense but a mature Lodestar. Ward or stepping aside keeps it off; Reflect turns it on you.
d.torment [169be7] = 包括本回合在内的三个回合里，对方每做一个行动，都要按其支付的可用法力的 {n} 倍付出生命，除升至顶点的引星外无视一切防御。护界或闪避可以挡下；反照会让它落回你身上。
# en: Move up to {n} of their ready Mana into your flux; your Mana plus flux can't pass capacity. Ward or stepping aside stops it; Reflect turns it on you.
d.extraction [586b0b] = 把对方至多 {n} 点可用法力转为你的游离法力；你的法力加游离法力不能超过上限。护界或闪避可以挡下；反照会让它落回你身上。
# en: Start and each Hold deal {n} spell damage before defenses. Release heals actual damage dealt; Holds cost {cost} Mana.
d.siphon [10e812] = 开始时及每次蓄持，在防御前造成 {n} 点法术伤害。释放时按实际造成的伤害治疗；每次蓄持消耗 {cost} 点法力。
# en: Seize their move of this exchange: it plays as usual, then they must repeat it for the next {n}, shown in advance; a turn they can't repeat it is lost. Ward or stepping aside keeps it off; Reflect turns it on you. Not in the first exchange.
d.compel [e0026b] = 夺下对方本回合的行动：它照常生效，之后接下来 {n} 里对方必须重复它，并提前公开；无法重复的回合作废。护界或闪避可以挡下；反照会让它落回你身上。第一回合不能施放。
